  "body": "## Problem\n\nHive Mind 2.5.2 rejects the Formal AI provider before Agent CLI starts:\n\n```text\nsolve ISSUE_URL --tool agent --model formal-ai\nUnrecognized model: \"formal-ai\"\nAvailable models for agent: ...\n```\n\nThe Agent CLI itself supports `formal-ai` / `formalai/formal-ai`, and `src/agent.lib.mjs` already passes unknown model IDs through (`agentModels[model] || model`), but model validation in `src/models/index.mjs` rejects this provider alias first.\n\n## Requested change\n\n- Add `formal-ai` to `agentModels` (mapping to `formalai/formal-ai`) and the agent validation model map.\n- Add a test proving `solve ... --tool agent --model formal-ai --only-prepare-command` reaches command preparation.\n\n## Context\n\nDiscovered while implementing link-assistant/formal-ai#655, whose required outer loop is exactly Hive Mind → Agent CLI → `formal-ai serve --agent-mode`.",
